 "remarks": "An antique jewel set on 3.5 extraordinary acres in the heart of Greens Farms, ready to be transformed into your forever home. Brimming with timeless charm and endless potential, this rare offering showcases beautiful period details, including arched doorways, custom built-ins, and charming deep-set windows that reflect the home's historic character. The gracious main house is complemented by a separate art studio, detached two-car garage, tennis court, and pool-creating a true country compound in one of Westport's most coveted locations. The property is enhanced by stunning specimen plantings, expansive open grounds, and complete deer fencing surrounding the entire lot. A remarkable opportunity to restore, renovate, or reimagine a treasured estate in an unparalleled setting.",
